<title>SWEDEN: Riksbank says Sweden should join EMU from start.</title>
<headline>Riksbank says Sweden should join EMU from start.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>In a major policy announcement, Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, said on Friday that Sweden should join the European Union's Economic and Monetary Union (EMU) from the start on January 1, 1999.</p>
</text>
